usly he reveals that spotless  indeed contains phmg which is a very  harmful substance it can cause  congestion coughing or or even lung  failure if not treated on time this  slightly swings the tie in youngju's  favor but just then the defendant's  attorney Byung Sook steps forward with  an article he shows it to the chemist  and makes him read it aloud surprisingly  it is the chemist's OWN article which he  had written in 2004 it states that phmg  is not harmful at all as a result Chen's  group once again gains the upper hand  after a while it is the government  chemist's turn who was previously bribed  as expected he lies that the toxicology  results came out negative meaning  spotless disinfectant is completely safe  as it doesn't contain harmful levels of  phmg he also asserts that his findings  are correct as a member of youngju's  group was with him during the entire  test this shocks the families of the  infected and they begin wondering who  has backstabbed them lo and behold it is  revealed to be none other than Jung  himself with a heavy heart he claims  that the process was fair and there was  no foul play involved as a result of  this Shannon has company O2 win the case  much to the displeasure of young ju the  following day Chen hosts a lavish party  for all of those who helped him among  them is also the chemist who is supposed  to help youngju this reveals that Chen  bribed everyone who came in his way in  the next scene Chen is at the airport  ready to return to London when a bunch  of officers approach him he arrogantly  asks them to move as he has a flight to  catch but the officers inform him that  he is on the no-fly list today this  stuns Chen and he quickly realizes that  he has been found out elsewhere wushik  is watching the news which states that  O2 has finally been exposed the lab  report which the government chemist gave  turned out to be fabricated surprisingly  he starts crying profusely and the movie  goes into a flashback it turns ou